### Trigger Schedule Planner agent
POST http://localhost:8005/agent/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "task": "Check if the Grand Ballroom is available on March 15th"
}

### Crash Recovery: run the graph under an ID you own
### Blocks for ~30s while step 2 runs. Kill the app during that window with the
### request below. Restarting the app is what recovers the run; send this exact
### request again only to read back its answer, because the crash killed the
### connection that was waiting for one.
### Add "kill_after_seconds": 8 to the body and the app halts itself 8s in, so you
### can skip the kill request below and run the demo in two terminals.
POST http://localhost:8001/crash/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id": "gala-42",
    "topic": "company gala on March 15"
}

### Crash Recovery: kill the app while the run above is in flight
POST http://localhost:8001/crash/kill
